":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},"itemId","iepvrh0cnji8gnmctayok0ho0","Rackspace Spot 云平台遭入侵，攻击者读取客户 Kubernetes Secrets","summary","攻击者使用泄露凭据入侵 Rackspace Spot 云平台，在部分客户组织中以合法用户身份创建 Kubernetes Pod、读取 Secrets，并列出节点和卷，受害凭据可能包括密码、认证令牌、API 密钥及 Spot API 令牌。","sourceName","BleepingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/rackspace-spot-breach-let-hackers-access-customer-kubernetes-secrets/","publishedAt","2026-11-21T22:59:58.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,{"_196":223,"_177":-5,"_198":224},{"_196":209,"_177":-5,"_198":210},{"_196":197,"_177":-5,"_198":199},"label","研究与披露","items",[200],{"_174":201,"_56":202,"_177":203,"_179":204,"_181":205,"_183":206,"_185":207,"_187":208,"_189":190,"_191":192},"dfh23lubzfof7rir61cxf0nq4","NebuSec 演示恶意网页劫持 Meta Muse 并读取私人聊天与记忆","NebuSec 演示恶意网页可绕过审批提示，从 Meta Muse 云端机器提取并篡改用户聊天记录与存储记忆，并结合内置浏览器和 Linux 内核缺陷取得机器控制权，访问凭据存储、保存文件及 Sentinel。攻击仅影响单台云端机器，未进入共享服务器或其他用户设备；研究为实验室演示，NebuSec 称所披露弱点均已修复，但 Meta 尚未公开确认，补丁发布前是否有用户数据被访问也未说明。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/a-single-malicious-webpage-let.html","2026-11-21T11:53:07.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","攻击与威胁",[211,212],{"_174":218,"_56":219,"_177":220,"_179":180,"_181":221,"_183":222,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":213,"_56":214,"_177":215,"_179":180,"_181":216,"_183":217,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},"dbml5ujd9k2y3agezdbxfdnmx","BADBOX 3.0 botnet 回归，每日发起 40 亿次欺诈广告竞价请求","HUMAN 的 Satori 研究人员发现 BADBOX 3.0 通过受感染的 Android 设备每日发起约 40 billion 次欺诈广告竞价请求，峰值占其观察到的 CTV 流量的 4% 以上。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/badbox-30-botnet-returns-with-record-breaking-40-billion-daily-ad-requests/","2026-11-21T15:17:27.000Z","lwn1awdsmrazlhsmt4r21vq0w","Microsoft Entra Connect Health 漏洞遭利用，租户数据被未授权访问","攻击者利用 Microsoft Entra Connect Health API 漏洞，未授权读取租户级元数据，并可能修改 Connect Health 监控配置。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsoft-entra-connect-health-flaw-exploited-to-steal-tenant-data/","2026-11-21T18:01:58.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[225],{"_174":146,"_56":120,"_177":226,"_179":204,"_181":227,"_183":228,"_185":207,"_187":208,"_189":190,"_191":192},"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 的 4 个漏洞列入 KEV，依据是已发现活跃利用证据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-critical-vmware-cisco.html","2026-11-21T08:49:13.000Z",{"_174":218,"_56":219,"_177":220,"_179":180,"_181":221,"_183":222,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":213,"_56":214,"_177":215,"_179":180,"_181":216,"_183":217,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":201,"_56":202,"_177":203,"_179":204,"_181":205,"_183":206,"_185":207,"_187":208,"_189":190,"_191":192},"leadParagraph",{"_234":235,"_236":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
